<section class="section container narrow"><p class="eyebrow">LET’S MAKE SOMETHING PERSONAL</p><h1>{{ page.title | default: 'A piece of your own.' | escape }}</h1><div class="richtext">{{ page.content }}</div><p>Tell us what you have in mind. This is an inquiry, not an order or a confirmed quote.</p>{% form 'contact' %}{% if form.posted_successfully? %}<p role="status">Your inquiry was sent. Thank you for sharing your idea.</p>{% else %}{{ form.errors | default_errors }}<input type="hidden" name="contact[subject]" value="Custom project inquiry"><label for="Quote-name">Name</label><input id="Quote-name" type="text" name="contact[name]" required><label for="Quote-email">Email</label><input id="Quote-email" type="email" name="contact[email]" required><label for="Quote-phone">Phone (optional)</label><input id="Quote-phone" type="tel" name="contact[phone]" ><label for="Quote-dimensions">Dimensions and units</label><input id="Quote-dimensions" type="text" name="contact[dimensions]" ><label for="Quote-wood">Wood preferences</label><input id="Quote-wood" type="text" name="contact[wood]" ><label for="Quote-engraving">Engraving or personalization</label><input id="Quote-engraving" type="text" name="contact[engraving]" ><label for="Quote-budget">Budget range and currency</label><input id="Quote-budget" type="text" name="contact[budget]" ><label for="Quote-timeline">Ideal timeline</label><input id="Quote-timeline" type="text" name="contact[timeline]" ><label for="Quote-type">Project type</label><select id="Quote-type" name="contact[Project type]" required><option value="">Choose a project</option><option>Cribbage board</option><option>Cutting board</option><option>Cheese slicer</option><option>Coasters</option><option>Other custom project</option></select><label for="Quote-description">Project description</label><textarea id="Quote-description" name="contact[body]" rows="7" required></textarea><div class="notice"><strong>Reference images</strong><p>Secure image uploads are not configured. Please describe your references here; we can arrange a secure way to share images after your inquiry. Do not send sensitive information.</p></div><p class="muted">Sent using Shopify’s contact form. Delivery requires a valid store contact email; this theme does not provide a quote database or file storage.</p><button class="button" type="submit">Send project inquiry</button>{% endif %}{% endform %}</section>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Custom project request",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
